WEBVTT

00:02:27.676 --> 00:02:31.236
is one of the greatest achievements
of scientific research

00:02:31.236 --> 00:02:32.836
in the last century.

00:02:34.636 --> 00:02:38.476
A scientific model that describes
the properties and behavior

00:02:38.516 --> 00:02:41.196
of all the known particles
in the universe.

00:02:41.196 --> 00:02:44.716
And as particle physicists
have no imagination,

00:02:44.716 --> 00:02:46.796
we call it the Standard Model.

00:02:48.396 --> 00:02:51.756
For me, having one model
with so much power

00:02:51.796 --> 00:02:54.796
is as close as science gets
to describing nature

00:02:54.836 --> 00:02:56.876
at its most basic level.

00:02:58.916 --> 00:03:01.636
When I first heard
about the Standard Model,